  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 10,
      "describe_ch": "了解函數和圖形的定義。了解函數的極限，並能夠通過應用基本公式來計算極限。了解導數的定義，並能夠通過基本屬性計算導數。能夠應用導數來分析函數的單調性和凹性。能夠應用導數解決最大和最小問題。了解積分的概念，並能應用微積分基本定理計算積分。能夠使用定積分來獲得曲線之間區域的面積。能夠找到對數、指數和三角函數的導數。了解偏導數並能夠通過基本屬性計",
      "describe_en": "Understand the definition of the functions and graphs. Understand the limits of functions and be able to compute the limits by applying basic formulas. Understand the definition of the derivatives and be able to compute the derivatives via basic properties. Be able to apply the derivatives to analyze the monotonicity and concavity of functions. Be able to apply the derivatives to solve the maximum and minimum problems.\r\n"
    }
  ],
